laya-code-r2 is a fine-tuned derivative of ModernBERT-base:
  answerdotai/ModernBERT-base (revision 8949b909ec900327062f0ebf497f51aef5e6f0c8)
  Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/answerdotai/ModernBERT-base

Its decision head follows the architecture of Laya's reference code; no Laya weights are used:
  convaiinnovations/laya, Copyright Convai Innovations, Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
  reference code from https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya, Apache License 2.0

Modified from ModernBERT-base (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
  model.safetensors      the ModernBERT-base encoder fine-tuned, plus a randomly initialised and
                         trained decision head, in the laya-code layout (F16, temperature F32)
  rl_agent_config.json   laya-code's agent configuration: max_len, noul:2 temperature, finetune
                         record, serving block

Unchanged from ModernBERT-base:
  encoder/config.json, tokenizer/tokenizer.json, tokenizer/tokenizer_config.json

Unchanged from Laya's reference code (as in the earlier laya-code revisions):
  rl_agent_api.py, rl_common.py

The earlier revisions on the main and r1 branches are fine-tunes of Laya itself; their NOTICE
files describe them.
